    "text": "Having HIV stage two increased odds of anemia by 2.059 times, while the odds were increased by 3.093 for those with stage three. This was in agreement with findings by [9] who reported that the risk of anemia increased as HIV-clinical stage increased [9]. A higher HIV stage increases risk of opportu",
